      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If your internal briefing suggests the local leaders actively appreciate this kind of authentic, colorful language, then it is a calculated risk worth taking. In that specific context, the phrase functions less as a crude metaphor and more as a recognized cultural touchstone signifying abundance and vitality. To lean into it shows genuine engagement, which is exactly what you want to project to build that crucial rapport. Just ensure you deliver it with a tone of warm appreciation, not irony, and it will land perfectly.",
